<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>OScope: third-party notices</title>
<style>
:root { color-scheme: light dark; }
body { font: 14px system-ui, sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 12px 16px; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; padding: 8px; border: 1px solid #8884; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party notices</h1>
<p>OScope's server is under the MIT licence. It is built with the crates below, each under the licence named, whose text follows. Beside this file:</p>
<ul>
<li><code>Roboto-LICENSE.txt</code>: the Roboto fonts, by Google, which the server embeds to write reports (Apache License 2.0).</li>
<li><code>typst-assets-0.15.1-NOTICE.txt</code>: the data that the crate typst-assets bundles, which the server embeds: colour profiles, Unicode data, and HTML and MathML tables. Its fonts aren't embedded.</li>
</ul>
<h2>The licences</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}
<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a>: {{count}} crates</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}
<li><a href="{{#if crate.repository}}{{crate.repository}}{{else}}https://crates.io/crates/{{crate.name}}/{{crate.version}}{{/if}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a></li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
